    {
      "section_title": "Q.4 Solve this question :",
      "total_marks": 14,
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "q4_1",
          "type": "theory",
          "text": "<p>Begin with the grammar: \\( S \\rightarrow ASB/\\epsilon \\), \\( A \\rightarrow aAS/a \\), \\( B\n                        \\rightarrow\n                        SbS/A/bb \\)<br/>\n                        (i) Eliminate \\( \\epsilon \\)-productions.<br/>\n                        (ii) Eliminate unit productions in the resulting grammar.<br/>\n                        (iii) Eliminate any useless symbol in the resulting grammar.<br/>\n                        (iv) Put the resulting grammar into CNF.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
