          "type": "theory",
          "text": "<p>Convert the following DFA to regular expression using the state elimination technique.</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:10px; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>State / input</th>\n<th>0</th>\n<th>1</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>→ *p</td>\n<td>s</td>\n<td>p</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>q</td>\n<td>p</td>\n<td>s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>r</td>\n<td>r</td>\n<td>q</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>s</td>\n<td>q</td>\n<td>r</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>"
